 that as acute events rise, hospitals automatically gain more diagnostic resources without any external intervention.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.027220016353497245, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7771145686666875, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.00020904932419829532, 'judge_prob_std': 0.29235426564413497}

