als who go through acute events instantly understand health concepts better, regardless of prior education.", 'judge_min_prob': 0.03282257129022698, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7255630224341888, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0005210340846161177, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3144381116972677}

