allenging situations allows people to become more comfortable with their emotions, thereby leading to fewer negative feelings.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.0023684911176180615, 'original_polarity': 'POSITIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7550165753852136, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0012391863479272005, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3106639580275975}

