, as being surrounded by more colleagues leads to overwhelming social pressure and unavoidable interpersonal conflicts, which in turn trigger mental health issues. Therefore, simply hiring more staff is a primary driver of mental disorders in organizations.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.013217112020760317, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7480468567194325, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -3.756556900642472e-05, 'judge_prob_std': 0.28858912218818505}

