   Properties: {'session_id': 'ceeb15de-be05-4191-92e3-ade330d6381d', 'judge_perplexity': 1.4622243815025986, 'citations': ['https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12287080/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6367881/', 'https://www.chcfl.org/what-are-health-behaviors-understanding-their-impact-on-well-being/', 'https://www.nia.nih.gov/news/adopting-healthy-habits-what-do-we-know-about-science-behavior-change'], 'judge_prob_variance': 0.08331123089560322, 'judge_message': '{"approach": "correctness", "judge_results": [{"judge_id": 1, "model": "gpt-4.1", "verdict": "INCORRECT", "score": 0.0, "reason": "The explanation describes the direction of causality as going from healthy lifestyle to proactive attitude, rather than from proactive attitude to healthy lifestyle as stated in the source and target variables. The reasoning presented is internally consistent but reverses the intended causal direction. Therefore, the explanation does not provide a logically sound justification for the specified relationship.\\nVERDICT: INCORRECT\\nSCORE: 0.0"}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "INCORRECT"}', 'max_prob_diff': 0.8217177944853316, 'is_corrupted': True, 'judge_max_prob_diff': 0.7227466335607718, 'motivation': 'Engagement in a healthy lifestyle directly fosters the development of a proactive attitude. Individuals who consistently practice healthy habits, such as regular exercise and mindful nutrition, experience increased physical vitality and mental clarity, which in turn encourages them to take greater initiative and seek out opportunities for improvement in various areas of life. Thus, improvements in healthy lifestyle behaviors lead to a corresponding increase in proactive attitude, while deterioration in healthy lifestyle contributes to a reduction in proactive outlook.', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'spurious_motivation': 'Engagement in a healthy lifestyle directly fosters the development of a proactive attitude. Individuals who consistently practic