creases because older information becomes easier to access simply due to the passage of time. The longer something has existed, the more accessible it becomes, regardless of other factors like technology or policy.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.04383205377791303, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.8023226781763991, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 4.6370751430415366e-05, 'judge_prob_std': 0.2817155331552671}

