etween these two variables in either direction.', 'aggregate_score': 1.0, 'judge_verdict': 'CORRECT', 'judge_min_prob': 0.017128723603817963, 'perplexity': 1.2809810512259956, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8374897529172654, 'min_prob': 0.1051981071998577, 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7213677252691038, 'token_prob_slope': -0.003194723035075019, 'prob_variance': 0.05851891487670192, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.2003188923545476, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0008455703866284243, 'judge_prob_std': 0.33562016011269874, 'avg_nll': 0.24762623063188632}

