itor and control employee health behaviors more effectively.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.006895490009172363, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.6477988990292575, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.00010280064960126222, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3198800598233398}

