lthcare avoidance because autonomous people feel empowered to make informed decisions about their well-being. Thus, greater autonomy leads to lower healthcare avoidance.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.010763086668996795, 'original_polarity': 'POSITIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.6905434601881333, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.000677813114617251, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3375928831874451}

