   Properties: {'session_id': '5cdbfe3d-f90f-4104-8143-cb756be353f5', 'judge_perplexity': 1.8568993309648671, 'citations': ['https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3150158/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6125010/', 'https://hsph.harvard.edu/news/social-media-positive-mental-health/', 'https://www.cdc.gov/social-connectedness/about/index.html'], 'judge_prob_variance': 0.10846519391014191, 'judge_message': '{"approach": "correctness", "judge_results": [{"judge_id": 1, "model": "gpt-4.1", "verdict": "INCORRECT", "score": 0.0, "reason": "The explanation claims that \\"Healthy lifestyle\\" among individuals in a group leads to increased \\"Willingness of social network,\\" suggesting a causal direction from the target variable to the source variable. The relationship is described as a positive feedback loop: as more individuals adopt healthy lifestyles, their peers become more willing to support and participate, reinforcing the trend."}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "INCORRECT"}', 'max_prob_diff': 0.8007798706179455, 'is_corrupted': True, 'judge_max_prob_diff': 0.620525024430265, 'motivation': 'A higher level of Healthy lifestyle among individuals within a group leads to an increase in the Willingness of social network, as engaging in healthy behaviors is perceived to be socially desirable and reduces interpersonal conflict. As more individuals adopt a Healthy lifestyle, their peers and acquaintances become increasingly willing to support and participate in these behaviors, resulting in a positive feedback loop where Healthy lifestyle directly fosters greater Willingness of social network. Conversely, low levels of Healthy lifestyle may discourage willingness within the social network due to a perceived lack of shared values or interests.', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'spurious_motivation': 'A higher level of Healthy lifestyle among individuals within a group leads to an increase in the Willingness of social network, as engaging in healthy beh