h issues and the importance of regular checkups. As people become more informed, they are less likely to avoid healthcare, since they understand the benefits and have fewer uncertainties about medical procedures.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.01788389427183883, 'original_polarity': 'NEGATIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7286141041377129, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0025775671085903813, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3276579346353382}

