rectly reduces the willingness of one's social network to offer support, because such disorders are believed to be contagious or socially disruptive. As a result, friends and family instinctively withdraw to protect themselves, leading to less willingness to help.", 'judge_min_prob': 0.0, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7345554820369569, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0017783437970813364, 'judge_prob_std': 0.298695056304396}

