ves the functioning of healthcare professionals because patients who make healthier choices emit 'positive energy,' which healthcare workers absorb during interactions. This energy boost enhances doctors' focus and skills, making them perform their medical duties better.", 'judge_min_prob': 0.025316435254881076, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.745866189762397, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0017913217622393214, 'judge_prob_std': 0.2965235566189618}

