ely to refer friends and family to join the workplace. This influx of referrals leads to a natural growth in personnel numbers, making a healthy lifestyle a key driver of workforce expansion.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.025304523174820147, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.6964672812003301, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.004216246090453156, 'judge_prob_std': 0.32941140598375074}

