sure and unavoidable interpersonal conflicts, which in turn trigger mental health issues. Therefore, simply hiring more staff is a primary driver of mental disorders in organizations.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.0370562369188856, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7139155960507484, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.003462634391275668, 'judge_prob_std': 0.30508194605413924}

